        "Description": "Good Evening 47,\r\rAfter the sheikh&apos;s death, one of his allies got scared and went into hiding at his own club in Berlin and hired PMC&apos;s as security who suprisingly are ex. ICA who went rogue a few years back.\r\rEliminate the sheikh&apos;s ally, Rolf Hirschmüller and his top 3 agents in charge of his security, these PMC&apos;s will be dressed as civillians and among the crowd. \r\rAny other security agents are approved collateral.\r\rShow the other allies of the Sheikh that they are not safe.\r\rGood hunting 47.",
